   "text_jp": "あヒスけロスけズスけズタけボスけボスけボスけボスけボスけOスけ♀スけやセけざセけょセけバセけ(セけぎソけぎソけヶソけ♀ソけぎタけサタけ厂",
   "translation_en": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "offset": 97066,
   "length_bytes": 6,
   "raw_hex": "502621204002",
   "text_jp": "ょよむみぶい",
   "translation_en": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "offset": 155716,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "0a80033c0c546384ff",
   "text_jp": "こうでしウツ民",
   "translation_en": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "offset": 174138,
   "length_bytes": 3,
   "raw_hex": "023418",
   "text_jp": "いざね",
   "translation_en": "Well then."
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "offset": 183902,
   "length_bytes": 3,
   "raw_hex": "023418",
   "text_jp": "いざね",
   "translation_en": "Well then."
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "offset": 224126,
   "length_bytes": 3,
   "raw_hex": "102601",
   "text_jp": "たよあ",
   "translation_en": ""
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "offset": 289970,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "81db2f0129190680d0",
   "text_jp": "注があるのか?",
   "translation_en": "Do you have business here?"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "offset": 290056,
   "length_bytes": 23,
   "raw_hex": "25071980cb80da527875811482b0198491820d80db80d7",
   "text_jp": "ゆきの:｜アラヤ神扎の由禾』…",
   "translation_en": "Yukino: \"Origins of Araya Shrine\"..."
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "offset": 290091,
   "length_bytes": 12,
   "raw_hex": "812419821019815f1683df21",
   "text_jp": "人の沚の宇に任む",
   "translation_en": "Residing within the hearts of humanity,"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "offset": 290109,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "1f124d1023193c0d80db",
   "text_jp": "まつったものです』",
   "translation_en": "is what is enshrined here.\""
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "offset": 290121,
   "length_bytes": 4,
   "raw_hex": "394d130b",
   "text_jp": "だってさ",
   "translation_en": "or so it says."
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "offset": 290154,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "817d15836181401880d1",
   "text_jp": "変な名前ね!",
   "translation_en": "What a strange name!"
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "offset": 290176,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "01291906154880d0",
   "text_jp": "あるのかなぁ?",
   "translation_en": "I wonder if there is...?"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "offset": 290347,
   "length_bytes": 7,
   "raw_hex": "0b2a13184b2e39",
   "text_jp": "されてねぇんだ",
   "translation_en": "hasn't been done."
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "offset": 290373,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "821b29747f2f184b4d1381aa3937",
   "text_jp": "見るモンがねぇって話だぜ",
   "translation_en": "They say there's nothing to see."
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "offset": 290407,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "81ae2a15064d104d0980d7",
   "text_jp": "入れなかったっけ…",
   "translation_en": "Couldn't we go inside...?"
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "offset": 290451,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "83e786312f01291916",
   "text_jp": "愴跡があるのに",
   "translation_en": "Even though there are ruins,"
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "offset": 290467,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "81ae2a15022e3c0d231918",
   "text_jp": "入れないんですものね",
   "translation_en": "we still can't enter, can we?"
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "offset": 290576,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "82e2322912232880d0",
   "text_jp": "逃げるつもり?",
   "translation_en": "Are you trying to run away?"
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "offset": 290609,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "83bd272a292680d1",
   "text_jp": "怒られるよ!",
   "translation_en": "You're gonna get yelled at!"
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "offset": 290646,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "82e232291223280680d0",
   "text_jp": "逃げるつもりか?",
   "translation_en": "Are you planning to run?"
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "offset": 290720,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "839c1f4d13022980d7",
   "text_jp": "閉まっている…",
   "translation_en": "It's closed..."
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "offset": 290883,
   "length_bytes": 7,
   "raw_hex": "827b4d10140528",
   "text_jp": "思ったとおり",
   "translation_en": "Just as I thought,"
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "offset": 290903,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "82e232290a141a3c072e1402030a1439",
   "text_jp": "逃げることはできんということだ",
   "translation_en": "it means running away is not an option."
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "offset": 291021,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "81980c13082a2680d1",
   "text_jp": "申してくれよ!",
   "translation_en": "Let me out!"
  },
  {
   "id": 25,
   "offset": 291057,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "815a0913082a26809e80cc80d1",
   "text_jp": "肪けてくれよォ{204}!",
   "translation_en": "Save meee!"
  },
  {
   "id": 26,
   "offset": 291108,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "839c1f4d13022980d7",
   "text_jp": "閉まっている…",
   "translation_en": "It's closed..."
  },
  {
   "id": 27,
   "offset": 291201,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "83212a1381d2061508131a80d1",
   "text_jp": "達れて行かなくては!",
   "translation_en": "We have to take them with us!"
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "offset": 291264,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "81630c13022980d7",
   "text_jp": "化している…",
   "translation_en": "has transformed..."
  },
  {
   "id": 29,
   "offset": 291307,
   "length_bytes": 7,
   "raw_hex": "527f114e2e2714",
   "text_jp": "アンちゃんらと",
   "translation_en": "with those big bros"
  },
  {
   "id": 30,
   "offset": 291345,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "81ae4d13024d1038",
   "text_jp": "入っていったぞ",
   "translation_en": "went inside!"
  },
  {
   "id": 31,
   "offset": 291394,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "839c340b2a13022980d7",
   "text_jp": "閉ざされている…",
   "translation_en": "It's sealed shut..."
  },
  {
   "id": 32,
   "offset": 291451,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "0a0a2f82aa82ab0680d0",
   "text_jp": "ここが警察か?",
   "translation_en": "Is this the police station?"
  },
  {
   "id": 33,
   "offset": 291463,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "849e83401a83cc3909160c2b80d1",
   "text_jp": "定談は顔だけにしろ!",
   "translation_en": "Keep the jokes to your face!"
  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "offset": 291583,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "0a2e1584d784b60281a3834616",
   "text_jp": "こんな薄角い場斯に",
   "translation_en": "In a dark and gloomy place like this,"
  },
  {
   "id": 35,
   "offset": 291598,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "81db1a8162021a36392b0380d0",
   "text_jp": "注は無いはずだろう?",
   "translation_en": "you shouldn't have any business, right?"
  },
  {
   "id": 36,
   "offset": 291627,
   "length_bytes": 6,
   "raw_hex": "132e224b80d7",
   "text_jp": "てんめぇ…",
   "translation_en": "You bastard..."
  },
  {
   "id": 37,
   "offset": 291656,
   "length_bytes": 20,
   "raw_hex": "82428369166d786d780d2e192f828007152e3918",
   "text_jp": "本当にフラフラすんのが好きなんだね",
   "translation_en": "You really love wandering around aimlessly, don't ya?"
  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "offset": 291684,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "81921481a383462d81de3f1580d1",
   "text_jp": "時と場斯を選びな!",
   "translation_en": "Pick the right time and place!"
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "offset": 291700,
   "length_bytes": 5,
   "raw_hex": "4d100880d7",
   "text_jp": "ったく…",
   "translation_en": "Sheesh..."
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "offset": 291752,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "856583c919828580cb0a0a062781f11a",
   "text_jp": "黒服の女:ここから旡は",
   "translation_en": "Woman in Black: Beyond here..."
  },
  {
   "id": 41,
   "offset": 291770,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "5f8093591985058188822b3980d1",
   "text_jp": "セベクの管理下だ!",
   "translation_en": "is under SEBEC's jurisdiction!"
  },
  {
   "id": 42,
   "offset": 291786,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "81ba81d21a840f81860b2a13022980d1",
   "text_jp": "僵行は禁止されている!",
   "translation_en": "Passage is strictly prohibited!"
  },
  {
   "id": 43,
   "offset": 291818,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "04270f03164980d1",
   "text_jp": "えらそうにぃ!",
   "translation_en": "Acting so high and mighty!"
  },
  {
   "id": 44,
   "offset": 291832,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "5280a1617007114e0380d1",
   "text_jp": "アッタマきちゃう!",
   "translation_en": "That really ticks me off!"
  },
  {
   "id": 45,
   "offset": 291849,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "202e1580d15380d680a1808b80d1",
   "text_jp": "みんな!イ{214}ッダ!",
   "translation_en": "Everyone, let's go~!"
  },
  {
   "id": 46,
   "offset": 291964,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "0583e1354e15064d1080d780d0",
   "text_jp": "お埴じゃなかった…?",
   "translation_en": "Wasn't it a shrine...?"
  },
  {
   "id": 47,
   "offset": 292030,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "841c85ec875b83931519062680d0",
   "text_jp": "記蟷軣失なのかよ?",
   "translation_en": "Did you lose your memory?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 48,
   "offset": 292069,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "152e060f2e1582182f0c13071080d1",
   "text_jp": "なんかそんな気がしてきた!",
   "translation_en": "I'm starting to feel that way too!"
  },
  {
   "id": 49,
   "offset": 292088,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "834c0881d20a80d1",
   "text_jp": "帛く行こ!",
   "translation_en": "Let's hurry and go!"
  },
  {
   "id": 50,
   "offset": 292259,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "0a0a2f82aa82ab0680d0",
   "text_jp": "ここが警察か?",
   "translation_en": "Is this the police station?"
  },
  {
   "id": 51,
   "offset": 292271,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "849e83401a83cc3909160c2b80d1",
   "text_jp": "定談は顔だけにしろ!",
   "translation_en": "Keep the jokes to your face!"
  },
  {
   "id": 52,
   "offset": 292292,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "817b822580cb012a80d0",
   "text_jp": "悃希:あれ?",
   "translation_en": "Maki: Huh?"
  },
  {
   "id": 53,
   "offset": 292307,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "0583e1394d1014827b4d10093d80d7",
   "text_jp": "お埴だったと思ったけど…",
   "translation_en": "I thought it was a shrine..."
  },
  {
   "id": 54,
   "offset": 292427,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "0a2e1584d784b60281a3834616",
   "text_jp": "こんな薄角い場斯に",
   "translation_en": "In a dark and gloomy place like this,"
  },
  {
   "id": 55,
   "offset": 292442,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "81db1a8162021a36392b0380d0",
   "text_jp": "注は無いはずだろう?",
   "translation_en": "you shouldn't have any business, right?"
  },
  {
   "id": 56,
   "offset": 292471,
   "length_bytes": 6,
   "raw_hex": "132e224b80d7",
   "text_jp": "てんめぇ…",
   "translation_en": "You bastard..."
  },
  {
   "id": 57,
   "offset": 292504,
   "length_bytes": 12,
   "raw_hex": "0a2e15842c8187394d1080d0",
   "text_jp": "こんな建物だった?",
   "translation_en": "Was it always a building like this?"
  },
  {
   "id": 58,
   "offset": 292608,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "856583c919828580cb0a0a062781f11a",
   "text_jp": "黒服の女:ここから旡は",
   "translation_en": "Woman in Black: Beyond here..."
  },
  {
   "id": 59,
   "offset": 292626,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "5f8093591985058188822b3980d1",
   "text_jp": "セベクの管理下だ!",
   "translation_en": "is under SEBEC's jurisdiction!"
  },
  {
   "id": 60,
   "offset": 292642,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "81ba81d21a840f81860b2a13022980d1",
   "text_jp": "僵行は禁止されている!",
   "translation_en": "Passage is strictly prohibited!"
  },
  {
   "id": 61,
   "offset": 292674,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "04270f03164980d1",
   "text_jp": "えらそうにぃ!",
   "translation_en": "Acting so high and mighty!"
  },
  {
   "id": 62,
   "offset": 292688,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "5280a1617007114e0380d1",
   "text_jp": "アッタマきちゃう!",
   "translation_en": "That really ticks me off!"
  },
  {
   "id": 63,
   "offset": 292705,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "202e1580d15380d680a1808b80d1",
   "text_jp": "みんな!イ{214}ッダ!",
   "translation_en": "Everyone, let's go~!"
  },
  {
   "id": 64,
   "offset": 292724,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "25071980cb15162d04270f031680d7",
   "text_jp": "ゆきの:なにをえらそうに…",
   "translation_en": "Yukino: Acting all high and mighty..."
  },
  {
   "id": 65,
   "offset": 292745,
   "length_bytes": 10,
   "raw_hex": "821882372f813d081529",
   "text_jp": "気分が悪くなる",
   "translation_en": "Makes me sick."
  },
  {
   "id": 66,
   "offset": 292757,
   "length_bytes": 7,
   "raw_hex": "834c0881d20826",
   "text_jp": "帛く行くよ",
   "translation_en": "Let's hurry up."
  },
  {
   "id": 67,
   "offset": 292848,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "817b822580cb054d060c021580cc",
   "text_jp": "悃希:おっかしいな{204}",
   "translation_en": "Maki: That's strange~"
  },
  {
   "id": 68,
   "offset": 292867,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "0583e1354e15064d1080d780d0",
   "text_jp": "お埴じゃなかった…?",
   "translation_en": "Wasn't it a shrine...?"
  },
  {
   "id": 69,
   "offset": 292887,
   "length_bytes": 12,
   "raw_hex": "820d2a15021a3615191680d7",
   "text_jp": "禾れないはずなのに…",
   "translation_en": "We shouldn't be able to come here..."
  },
  {
   "id": 70,
   "offset": 292950,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "841c85ec875b83931519062680d0",
   "text_jp": "記蟷軣失なのかよ?",
   "translation_en": "Did you lose your memory?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 71,
   "offset": 292989,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "152e060f2e1582182f0c13071080d1",
   "text_jp": "なんかそんな気がしてきた!",
   "translation_en": "I'm starting to feel that way too!"
  },
  {
   "id": 72,
   "offset": 293008,
   "length_bytes": 8,
   "raw_hex": "834c0881d20a80d1",
   "text_jp": "帛く行こ!",
   "translation_en": "Let's hurry and go!"
  },
  {
   "id": 73,
   "offset": 293064,
   "length_bytes": 30,
   "raw_hex": "7080cc5980cb0a2e15034d1480cc0c80cc655b230381db1a184b392b80d0",
   "text_jp": "マ{204}ク:こんなうっと{204}し{204}トコもう注はねぇだろ?",
   "translation_en": "Mark: We don't got any more business in a dreary place like this, do we?"
  },
  {
   "id": 74,
   "offset": 293096,
   "length_bytes": 19,
   "raw_hex": "834c088114830780926219220c1681d20a0337",
   "text_jp": "帛く神取ブチのめしに行こうぜ",
   "translation_en": "Let's hurry up and go beat the crap outta Kandori!"
  },
  {
   "id": 75,
   "offset": 293152,
   "length_bytes": 20,
   "raw_hex": "817b822580cb83021981a383461681d2081980d0",
   "text_jp": "悃希:他の場斯に行くの?",
   "translation_en": "Maki: Are we going somewhere else?"
  },
  {
   "id": 76,
   "offset": 293178,
   "length_bytes": 4,
   "raw_hex": "202e1514",
   "text_jp": "みんなと",
   "translation_en": "Unleash our full power!"
  },
  {
   "id": 77,
   "offset": 293236,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "824b83ab80cb0a0a1681ae2a29191a",
   "text_jp": "南茱:ここに入れるのは",
   "translation_en": "Nanjo: The only ones who can enter here..."
  },
  {
   "id": 78,
   "offset": 293253,
   "length_bytes": 17,
   "raw_hex": "05814014829b843d3909191a36392b032f",
   "text_jp": "お前と園忖だけのはずだろうが",
   "translation_en": "should be you and Sonomura."
  },
  {
   "id": 79,
   "offset": 293337,
   "length_bytes": 7,
   "raw_hex": "81ae2a15022e39",
   "text_jp": "入れないんだ",
   "translation_en": "can't enter."
  },
  {
   "id": 80,
   "offset": 293428,
   "length_bytes": 31,
   "raw_hex": "813c811d83bf85b1809280a181370c135f80935916154d13102e39261580d0",
   "text_jp": "嘩菫厘敷ブッ壞してセベクになってたんだよな?",
   "translation_en": "They tore down the mansion and built SEBEC, right?"
  },
  {
   "id": 81,
   "offset": 293486,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "6153725e7980a18097152e0680d0",
   "text_jp": "タイムスリップなんか?",
   "translation_en": "Did we time slip or something?"
  },
  {
   "id": 82,
   "offset": 293520,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "817b822580cb0a4d11354e",
   "text_jp": "悃希:こっちじゃ",
   "translation_en": "Maki: In this world,"
  },
  {
   "id": 83,
   "offset": 293537,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "0a03394d10093d80d7",
   "text_jp": "こうだったけど…",
   "translation_en": "it was like this, but..."
  },
  {
   "id": 84,
   "offset": 293596,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "0a2e15655b820d132981a382490680d0",
   "text_jp": "こんなトコ禾てる場合か?",
   "translation_en": "Is this really the time to be coming to a place like this?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 85,
   "offset": 293614,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "83021624295b65012e392b80d0",
   "text_jp": "他にやるコトあんだろ?",
   "translation_en": "Don't we have other things to do?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 86,
   "offset": 293664,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "817b822580cb0119824e1a",
   "text_jp": "悃希:あの子は",
   "translation_en": "Maki: That child..."
  },
  {
   "id": 87,
   "offset": 293677,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "230339023550403926",
   "text_jp": "もうだいじょぶだよ",
   "translation_en": "is alright now."
  },
  {
   "id": 88,
   "offset": 293690,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "834c080c15021480d1",
   "text_jp": "帛くしないと!",
   "translation_en": "We have to hurry!"
  },
  {
   "id": 89,
   "offset": 293840,
   "length_bytes": 12,
   "raw_hex": "81d2082e354e1880cc190626",
   "text_jp": "行くんじゃね{204}のかよ",
   "translation_en": "Aren't we supposed to go?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 90,
   "offset": 293856,
   "length_bytes": 21,
   "raw_hex": "824b83ab80cb82b42d8198133d030d2982183980d0",
   "text_jp": "南茱:街を申てどうする気だ?",
   "translation_en": "Nanjo: What do you plan to do leaving the town?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 91,
   "offset": 293879,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "826282a91681d20819392b032f",
   "text_jp": "痞畭に行くのだろうが",
   "translation_en": "We are supposed to be going to the hospital!"
  },
  {
   "id": 92,
   "offset": 293920,
   "length_bytes": 4,
   "raw_hex": "587b2926",
   "text_jp": "キレるよ",
   "translation_en": "I'm gonna lose it."
  },
  {
   "id": 93,
   "offset": 293926,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "82b48198133d030d298218390280d1",
   "text_jp": "街申てどうする気だい!",
   "translation_en": "What do you plan to do leaving the town?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 94,
   "offset": 293945,
   "length_bytes": 6,
   "raw_hex": "1f4d100880d7",
   "text_jp": "まったく…",
   "translation_en": "Wasted all that sympathy."
  },
  {
   "id": 95,
   "offset": 294009,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "3d030d2982183980d0",
   "text_jp": "どうする気だ?",
   "translation_en": "What are you planning to do?"
  },
  {
   "id": 96,
   "offset": 294026,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "82b41982a61602292e393880d0",
   "text_jp": "街の東にいるんだぞ?",
   "translation_en": "is to the east of town, you know?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 97,
   "offset": 294076,
   "length_bytes": 32,
   "raw_hex": "7080cc5980cb5653565356535653565380d16d786d780c132981a382490680d0",
   "text_jp": "マ{204}ク:オイオイオイオイオイ!フラフラしてる場合か?",
   "translation_en": "Mark: Whoa-whoa-whoa! Is this really the time to be wandering around?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 98,
   "offset": 294110,
   "length_bytes": 18,
   "raw_hex": "2580cc115080cc157563391580cc80d180d1",
   "text_jp": "ゆ{204}ちょ{204}なヤツだな{204}!!",
   "translation_en": "You're taking your sweet time, aren't ya?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 99,
   "offset": 294140,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "0f4d11354e1880cc38",
   "text_jp": "そっちじゃね{204}ぞ",
   "translation_en": "It's not that way!"
  },
  {
   "id": 100,
   "offset": 294180,
   "length_bytes": 17,
   "raw_hex": "05350b2e80cb5680cc7053808180a180d1",
   "text_jp": "おじさん:オ{204}マイガッ!",
   "translation_en": "Middle-aged Man: Oh my God!"
  },
  {
   "id": 101,
   "offset": 294243,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "81ae2914821f15023880d1",
   "text_jp": "入ると危ないぞ!",
   "translation_en": "It's dangerous if you go in!"
  },
  {
   "id": 102,
   "offset": 294401,
   "length_bytes": 6,
   "raw_hex": "0a2a80d180d0",
   "text_jp": "これ!?",
   "translation_en": "What is this?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 103,
   "offset": 294409,
   "length_bytes": 16,
   "raw_hex": "82ad84192f816208154d132980d180d1",
   "text_jp": "学枚が無くなってる!!",
   "translation_en": "The school is gone!!"
  },
  {
   "id": 104,
   "offset": 294427,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "8491824e24202e151a80d180d0",
   "text_jp": "由子やみんなは!?",
   "translation_en": "Where are Yuko and everyone else?!"
  },
  {
   "id": 105,
   "offset": 294444,
   "length_bytes": 9,
   "raw_hex": "824b83ab80cb0a2a23",
   "text_jp": "南茱:これも",
   "translation_en": "Nanjo: Is this too..."
  },
  {
   "id": 106,
   "offset": 294455,
   "length_bytes": 20,
   "raw_hex": "808e8080809a80ce5d5e6472198534834e0680d7",
   "text_jp": "デヴァ'システムの髯釁か…",
   "translation_en": "the influence of the Deva System...?"
  },
  {
   "id": 107,
   "offset": 294483,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "1c340910827282bb2d80d1",
   "text_jp": "ふざけた真傑を!",
   "translation_en": "What outrageous mockery!"
  },
  {
   "id": 108,
   "offset": 294500,
   "length_bytes": 12,
   "raw_hex": "817b822580cb1e2e143980d1",
   "text_jp": "悃希:ほんとだ!",
   "translation_en": "Maki: It's true!"
  },
  {
   "id": 109,
   "offset": 294514,
   "length_bytes": 14,
   "raw_hex": "82ad84192f816208154d132980d1",
   "text_jp": "学枚が無くなってる!",
   "translation_en": "The school has disappeared!"
  },
  {
   "id": 110,
   "offset": 294566,
   "length_bytes": 17,
   "raw_hex": "0a2a23811483071981c582a315190680d0",
   "text_jp": "これも神取の意圖なのか?",
   "translation_en": "Is this also Kandori's doing?"
  },
  {
   "id": 111,
   "offset": 294587,
   "length_bytes": 6,
   "raw_hex": "02362a160c2b",
   "text_jp": "いずれにしろ",
   "translation_en": "In any case,"
  },
  {
   "id": 112,
   "offset": 294601,
   "length_bytes": 11,
   "raw_hex": "81d681d73d0316063c0729",
   "text_jp": "直悽どうにかできる",
   "translation_en": "directly fixing this"
  },
  {
   "id": 113,
   "offset": 294614,
   "length_bytes": 17,
   "raw_hex": "7b80937a19840b833e3c1a150b0f033915",
   "text_jp": "レベルの聞題ではなさそうだな",
   "translation_en": "does not seem to be a simple problem."
  },
  {
   "id": 114,
   "offset": 294654,
   "length_bytes": 13,
   "raw_hex": "757c80cc1681ef0b0e291f3c39",
   "text_jp": "ヤロ{204}に戻させるまでだ",
   "translation_en": "We just have to make that bastard restore it."
  },
  {
   "id": 115,
   "offset": 294687,
   "length_bytes": 15,
   "raw_hex": "53754d1280cc1e3d83300413242937",
   "text_jp": "イヤっつ{204}ほど教えてやるぜ",
   "translation_en": "We'll teach him a lesson he'll never forget!"
  }
 ]
}